<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>CardÃ¡pio Unificado de SoluÃ§Ãµes para Corte de Custos Â· Prefeitura de Sete Lagoas/MG</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f3f2ee; --bg-raised:#ffffff; --bg-sunk:#eceae4;
  --ink:#1a1d1c; --ink-soft:#4a504d; --ink-faint:#79807b;
  --line:#d8d5cd; --line-strong:#bdb9ae;
  --accent:#2f5563; --accent-soft:#e3eaed;
  --gold:#8f7128; --gold-soft:#f2ecdc;
  --piso:#2b6f55; --piso-bg:#e2efe9;
  --central:#2f5563; --central-bg:#e3eaed;
  --teto:#96702c; --teto-bg:#f4ecdb;
  --alerta:#9c463b; --alerta-bg:#f4e3e1;
  --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(26,29,28,.05), 0 10px 28px rgba(26,29,28,.06);
  --serif:"Iowan Old Style","Palatino Linotype",Palatino,Georgia,"Noto Serif",serif;
  --sans:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  --mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,"Liberation Mono",monospace;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
  :root{
    --bg:#15181a; --bg-raised:#1c2124; --bg-sunk:#111416;
    --ink:#e9eae6; --ink-soft:#b4bab5; --ink-faint:#7f8782;
    --line:#2f3739; --line-strong:#414a4c;
    --accent:#9dbcc9; --accent-soft:#212d33;
    --gold:#cda75a; --gold-soft:#33291431;
    --piso:#6dbb96; --piso-bg:#183026;
    --central:#9dbcc9; --central-bg:#212d33;
    --teto:#d5a95a; --teto-bg:#352b16;
    --alerta:#df8a80; --alerta-bg:#38211e;
    --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.35), 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#15181a; --bg-raised:#1c2124; --bg-sunk:#111416;
  --ink:#e9eae6; --ink-soft:#b4bab5; --ink-faint:#7f8782;
  --line:#2f3739; --line-strong:#414a4c;
  --accent:#9dbcc9; --accent-soft:#212d33;
  --gold:#cda75a; --gold-soft:#33291431;
  --piso:#6dbb96; --piso-bg:#183026;
  --central:#9dbcc9; --central-bg:#212d33;
  --teto:#d5a95a; --teto-bg:#352b16;
  --alerta:#df8a80; --alerta-bg:#38211e;
  --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.35), 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
}
:root[data-theme="light"]{
  --bg:#f3f2ee; --bg-raised:#ffffff; --bg-sunk:#eceae4;
  --ink:#1a1d1c; --ink-soft:#4a504d; --ink-faint:#79807b;
  --line:#d8d5cd; --line-strong:#bdb9ae;
  --accent:#2f5563; --accent-soft:#e3eaed;
  --gold:#8f7128; --gold-soft:#f2ecdc;
  --piso:#2b6f55; --piso-bg:#e2efe9;
  --central:#2f5563; --central-bg:#e3eaed;
  --teto:#96702c; --teto-bg:#f4ecdb;
  --alerta:#9c463b; --alerta-bg:#f4e3e1;
  --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(26,29,28,.05), 0 10px 28px rgba(26,29,28,.06);
}

*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth; scroll-padding-top:5.2rem}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
body{
  margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);
  font-family:var(--sans); font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;
  overflow-x:hidden; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;
}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--serif); margin:0; text-wrap:balance; font-weight:600}
p{margin:0 0 .9rem}
a{color:var(--accent)}

.wrap{max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 clamp(1rem,4vw,2.5rem)}
.narrow{max-width:820px}

/* ---------- navegaÃ§Ã£o fixa ---------- */
.topnav{
  position:sticky; top:0; z-index:60; background:var(--bg-raised);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.02);
}
.topnav-inner{
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem; min-height:3.6rem;
  justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; padding-top:.4rem; padding-bottom:.4rem;
}
.nav-brand{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.68rem; letter-spacing:.11em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint); white-space:nowrap;
}
.nav-brand strong{color:var(--accent); font-weight:600}
.nav-links{display:flex; gap:.25rem; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center}
.nav-links a{
  font-size:.78rem; letter-spacing:.03em; text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink-soft);
  padding:.42rem .6rem; border-radius:3px; white-space:nowrap;
}
.nav-links a:hover{background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent)}
.nav-links a.on{background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent); font-weight:600}
#themeBtn{
  border:1px solid var(--line); background:transparent; color:var(--ink-soft);
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.66rem; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:.4rem .6rem; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer;
}
#themeBtn:hover{border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent)}

/* ---------- capas ---------- */
.capa{
  min-height:88vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;
  padding:5rem 0 4rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.capa.geral{min-height:94vh}
.eyebrow{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.7rem; letter-spacing:.13em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint); display:block; margin-bottom:1rem;
}
.eyebrow .n{color:var(--gold); font-weight:600}
.capa h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5.2vw,3.5rem); line-height:1.06; max-width:19ch}
.capa h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4.4vw,2.9rem); line-height:1.08; max-width:20ch}
.capa .sub{
  margin-top:1.5rem; font-size:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.12rem); color:var(--ink-soft);
  max-width:64ch; line-height:1.62;
}
.regua{width:4.5rem; height:3px; background:var(--gold); margin:1.6rem 0 0; border-radius:2px}

/* ---------- blocos de faixa ---------- */
.faixa-tot{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr)); gap:1rem; margin-top:2.2rem}
.tot{
  background:var(--bg-raised); border:1px solid var(--line); border-top:3px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius:4px; padding:1.05rem 1.15rem; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.tot.piso{border-top-color:var(--piso)} .tot.central{border-top-color:var(--central)} .tot.teto{border-top-color:var(--teto)}
.tot .k{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.66rem; letter-spacing:.09em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint); display:block;
}
.tot .v{
  font-family:var(--serif); font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,1.75rem); display:block; margin-top:.35rem;
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; line-height:1.15;
}
.tot.piso .v{color:var(--piso)} .tot.central .v{color:var(--central)} .tot.teto .v{color:var(--teto)}
.tot .h{font-size:.78rem; color:var(--ink-faint); display:block; margin-top:.4rem; line-height:1.4}

.aviso{
  margin-top:1.6rem; padding:1rem 1.15rem; border-left:3px solid var(--gold);
  background:var(--gold-soft); border-radius:0 4px 4px 0; font-size:.92rem; line-height:1.6;
  color:var(--ink-soft);
}
.aviso strong{color:var(--ink)}
.aviso p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

/* ---------- sumÃ¡rio ---------- */
.sumario{padding:4rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg-sunk)}
.sumario h2{font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:.4rem}
.sum-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(255px,1fr)); gap:1.6rem; margin-top:2rem}
.sum-col h3{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.7rem; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:.7rem; font-weight:600;
}
.sum-col ol{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0}
.sum-col li{margin-bottom:.42rem; font-size:.88rem; line-height:1.45}
.sum-col li a{text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink-soft); display:block}
.sum-col li a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.sum-col li a .cid{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.72rem; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-right:.4rem}
.sum-col .parte-link{
  display:inline-block; font-family:var(--serif); font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--ink);
  text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:.6rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong);
}
.sum-col .parte-link:hover{color:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent)}

/* ---------- frentes ---------- */
.secao{padding:3.5rem 0 1rem}
.secao-title{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom:1.6rem; padding-bottom:.6rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.frente{
  background:var(--bg-raised); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:5px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow); margin-bottom:1.7rem; overflow:hidden;
}
.frente-head{padding:1.5rem clamp(1.1rem,2.5vw,1.8rem) .2rem}
.frente-meta{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.7rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:.75rem}
.frente-id{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.74rem; letter-spacing:.08em; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--bg-raised); background:var(--accent); padding:.24rem .55rem; border-radius:3px;
}
.frente-area{font-size:.78rem; color:var(--ink-faint); letter-spacing:.02em}
.selo{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.66rem; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:.26rem .55rem; border-radius:3px; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap;
}
.selo-forte{background:var(--piso-bg); color:var(--piso)}
.selo-mediaforte{background:var(--central-bg); color:var(--central)}
.selo-media{background:var(--teto-bg); color:var(--teto)}
.frente h3{font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.3vw,1.5rem); line-height:1.2; max-width:38ch}
.frente-prop{margin-top:.85rem; font-size:.95rem; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.6; max-width:78ch}

.faixa{
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr)); gap:.8rem;
  padding:1.2rem clamp(1.1rem,2.5vw,1.8rem) 1.3rem;
}
.fx{border:1px solid var(--line); border-left:3px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius:3px; padding:.7rem .85rem; background:var(--bg)}
.fx.piso{border-left-color:var(--piso)} .fx.central{border-left-color:var(--central)} .fx.teto{border-left-color:var(--teto)}
.fx .k{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.63rem; letter-spacing:.09em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-faint); display:block}
.fx .v{font-family:var(--serif); font-size:1.18rem; display:block; margin-top:.25rem; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.fx.piso .v{color:var(--piso)} .fx.central .v{color:var(--central)} .fx.teto .v{color:var(--teto)}

.piso-zero{
  margin:0 clamp(1.1rem,2.5vw,1.8rem) 1.2rem; padding:.75rem .95rem; font-size:.85rem;
  background:var(--bg-sunk); border-radius:3px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.5;
}
.piso-zero strong{color:var(--ink)}

details.mais{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
details.mais > summary{
  list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:.9rem clamp(1.1rem,2.5vw,1.8rem);
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:.07em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--accent); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; user-select:none;
}
details.mais > summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
details.mais > summary::before{content:"+"; font-size:1rem; line-height:1; width:.9rem; display:inline-block}
details.mais[open] > summary::before{content:"â€“"}
details.mais > summary:hover{background:var(--accent-soft)}
.detalhe{padding:.4rem clamp(1.1rem,2.5vw,1.8rem) 1.8rem; border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.detalhe h4{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.7rem; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--gold); margin:1.7rem 0 .6rem; font-weight:600;
}
.detalhe h4:first-child{margin-top:1.1rem}
.detalhe p, .detalhe li{font-size:.92rem; line-height:1.62; color:var(--ink-soft)}
.detalhe strong{color:var(--ink)}
.detalhe ul, .detalhe ol{margin:0 0 .9rem; padding-left:1.25rem}
.detalhe li{margin-bottom:.5rem}

.veredito{
  margin-top:1.5rem; padding:1.05rem 1.15rem; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:4px;
  background:var(--bg-sunk);
}
.veredito-top{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.7rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:.7rem}
.vd{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.68rem; letter-spacing:.07em; text-transform:uppercase;
  font-weight:600; padding:.26rem .6rem; border-radius:3px;
}
.vd-robusta{background:var(--piso-bg); color:var(--piso)}
.vd-condicional{background:var(--teto-bg); color:var(--teto)}
.vd-na{background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink-faint); border:1px solid var(--line)}
.vd-quem{font-size:.76rem; color:var(--ink-faint)}
.veredito p{margin-bottom:.6rem}
.veredito p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

.honestidade{
  margin-top:1.3rem; padding:1rem 1.15rem; border-left:3px solid var(--alerta);
  background:var(--alerta-bg); border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;
}
.honestidade .hk{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.66rem; letter-spacing:.09em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--alerta); font-weight:600; display:block; margin-bottom:.45rem;
}
.honestidade p{margin-bottom:.6rem}
.honestidade p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

.tabela-wrap{overflow-x:auto; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:4px; background:var(--bg); margin-bottom:1rem}
table.tb{border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; min-width:480px; font-size:.85rem}
table.tb th{
  text-align:left; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.66rem; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint); font-weight:600; padding:.6rem .9rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
table.tb td{padding:.55rem .9rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink-soft); vertical-align:baseline}
table.tb tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
table.tb td.num, table.tb th.num{font-family:var(--mono); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; text-align:right}
table.tb tr.sl td{background:var(--gold-soft); font-weight:600; color:var(--ink)}

.objeto{
  font-size:.9rem; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.6; border-left:2px solid var(--line);
  padding-left:1rem; margin-bottom:1.1rem;
}
.objeto .tag{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.64rem; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint); display:block; margin-bottom:.35rem;
}
.economia-card{
  margin:1.1rem 0; padding:1rem 1.15rem; border:1px dashed var(--line-strong); border-radius:4px;
}
.economia-card .k{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.66rem; letter-spacing:.09em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint); display:block; margin-bottom:.4rem;
}
.economia-card .v{font-family:var(--serif); font-size:1.12rem; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.4}
.economia-card .pipe{font-size:.8rem; color:var(--ink-faint); margin:.5rem 0 0; line-height:1.5}
.proximo{
  margin-top:1rem; background:var(--accent-soft); border-radius:4px; padding:.9rem 1.1rem;
  font-size:.9rem; line-height:1.55; color:var(--ink-soft);
}
.proximo .k{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.65rem; letter-spacing:.09em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--accent); display:block; margin-bottom:.3rem; font-weight:600;
}
.pill{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.66rem; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:.26rem .55rem; border-radius:3px; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap;
}
.pill.conf{background:var(--piso-bg); color:var(--piso)}
.pill.parcial{background:var(--teto-bg); color:var(--teto)}

.funil{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr)); gap:0; margin:2.2rem 0}
.funil .seg{padding:1.05rem 1.2rem; border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.funil .seg:last-child{border-right:none}
.funil .seg .big{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:2rem; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; display:block; line-height:1}
.funil .seg .cap{font-size:.8rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:.35rem; display:block; line-height:1.45}
.funil .seg.rej .big{color:var(--alerta)}
.funil .seg.apr .big{color:var(--piso)}

.rodape{
  border-top:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg-sunk); padding:2.6rem 0;
  font-size:.82rem; color:var(--ink-faint); line-height:1.6;
}
.rodape strong{color:var(--ink-soft)}
.voltar-topo{
  display:inline-block; margin-top:1rem; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.7rem;
  letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; text-decoration:none; color:var(--accent);
}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .capa{min-height:auto; padding:3.5rem 0 3rem}
  .capa.geral{min-height:auto}
  .funil .seg{border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="topnav">
  <div class="wrap topnav-inner">
    <span class="nav-brand"><strong>Sophos GovernanÃ§a</strong> Â· Sete Lagoas/MG</span>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#abertura">Abertura</a>
      <a href="#educacao">EducaÃ§Ã£o</a>
      <a href="#saude">SaÃºde</a>
      <a href="#contratos">Contratos</a>
      <a href="#sumario">SumÃ¡rio</a>
      <button id="themeBtn" type="button" aria-label="Alternar tema claro e escuro">Tema</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ===================== CAPA GERAL ===================== -->
<header class="capa geral" id="abertura">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="n">RelatÃ³rio executivo</span> Â· Documento de trabalho Â· Uso interno</span>
    <h1>CardÃ¡pio unificado de soluÃ§Ãµes para corte de custos</h1>
    <div class="regua"></div>
    <p class="sub">
      Vinte e uma frentes de reorganizaÃ§Ã£o orÃ§amentÃ¡ria para a Prefeitura Municipal de Sete Lagoas,
      distribuÃ­das em trÃªs blocos: EducaÃ§Ã£o, SaÃºde e contratos transversais de alto valor.
      Cada frente traz uma faixa de piso, central e teto, a metodologia que produziu esses
      nÃºmeros e as ressalvas que limitam o seu uso. Nenhuma faixa Ã© promessa de caixa.
    </p>
    <p class="sub">
      A leitura correta deste documento Ã© de cardÃ¡pio, nÃ£o de meta. O gestor escolhe as frentes
      que quer executar, sabendo de antemÃ£o o que cada uma exige em decisÃ£o polÃ­tica, parecer
      jurÃ­dico e dado ainda pendente. Onde o dado nÃ£o sustenta um nÃºmero, o documento diz isso
      com todas as letras em vez de arredondar para cima.
    </p>

    <div class="faixa-tot">
      <div class="tot piso">
        <span class="k">EducaÃ§Ã£o (SME) Â· 5 frentes</span>
        <span class="v">R$ 4.800.409,13</span>
        <span class="h">Piso somado. Central R$ 6.070.194,20 Â· Teto R$ 6.501.280,40</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tot central">
        <span class="k">SaÃºde (SMS) Â· 10 frentes</span>
        <span class="v">R$ 6.618.631</span>
        <span class="h">Piso somado (excl. CON-001 inviÃ¡vel). Central R$ 20.147.110 Â· Teto R$ 33.965.340</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tot teto">
        <span class="k">Contratos transversais Â· 6 frentes</span>
        <span class="v">Sem total</span>
        <span class="h">Faixas por caso, trÃªs delas indeterminadas. Somar seria inventar nÃºmero.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="aviso">
      <p><strong>Os trÃªs totais nÃ£o se somam.</strong> Cada bloco reÃºne naturezas orÃ§amentÃ¡rias
      diferentes. Em EducaÃ§Ã£o, desoneraÃ§Ã£o de folha temporÃ¡ria, aluguel de prÃ©dio e logÃ­stica de
      merenda. Em SaÃºde, economia recorrente, devoluÃ§Ã£o contÃ¡bil de exercÃ­cio, receita de
      governanÃ§a regional e risco condicional. Nos contratos transversais, faixas de renegociaÃ§Ã£o
      que dependem de quantitativos que o municÃ­pio ainda nÃ£o publica. Use os totais como ordem
      de grandeza por secretaria, nunca como caixa Ãºnico.</p>
      <p>O bloco de contratos nÃ£o recebe total porque metade dos casos tem economia
      classificada como indeterminada. Somar valores indeterminados produziria um nÃºmero
      confortÃ¡vel e falso.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ===================== SUMÃRIO ===================== -->
<section class="sumario" id="sumario">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">NavegaÃ§Ã£o</span>
